{%- comment -%}
  This section belongs to one page. In the default page template it sits beside
  the other designed pages and is given its page's handle, so it draws on that
  page and stays silent on every other. Without a handle it always draws.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if section.settings.only_handle == blank or page.handle == section.settings.only_handle -%}
{%- render 'section-design', section: section -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Region + grid controls. Every default reproduces the built page. The hallmark
  grid steps 4 → 2 → 1 at 1100px and 620px, so the column override is confined
  to the band the built rule owns — an id-specificity rule with no media query
  would otherwise flatten those steps on tablets and phones.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign cfg = section.settings
  assign root_sel = '#shopify-section-' | append: section.id

  comment
    Mobile group. Three grids, three phone tiers. The hallmarks step to one at
    620px, the archive photographs jump straight from three to one at 720px with
    nothing in between, and the figures row bottoms out at two across at 900px
    and never reaches one. That last one is hairline-separated, so a single
    column also has to move each rule from the side to the top, which is what
    the theme itself does for comparable rows at their narrowest step.
  endcomment
  assign sh_style = false
  if cfg.mark_cols != 4 or cfg.mark_cols_m != 2 or cfg.arch_cols_m != 2
    assign sh_style = true
  endif
  if cfg.arch_ratio_m != 'default' or cfg.stat_cols_m != 2
    assign sh_style = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if sh_style -%}
  <style>
    {%- if cfg.mark_cols != 4 -%}
      {{ root_sel }} { --mark-cols: {{ cfg.mark_cols }}; }
      @media (min-width: 1101px) {
        {{ root_sel }} .marks { grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--mark-cols), minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      }
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if cfg.mark_cols_m != 2 -%}
      @media (max-width: 620px) {
        {{ root_sel }} .marks { grid-template-columns: repeat({{ cfg.mark_cols_m }}, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      }
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if cfg.arch_cols_m != 2 or cfg.arch_ratio_m != 'default' -%}
      @media (max-width: 720px) {
        {%- if cfg.arch_cols_m != 2 -%}
          {{ root_sel }} .arch-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat({{ cfg.arch_cols_m }}, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if cfg.arch_ratio_m != 'default' -%}
          {{ root_sel }} .arch-grid figure { aspect-ratio: {{ cfg.arch_ratio_m }}; }
        {%- endif -%}
      }
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if cfg.stat_cols_m != 2 -%}
      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        {{ root_sel }} .craft__stats { grid-template-columns: repeat({{ cfg.stat_cols_m }}, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
        {%- if cfg.stat_cols_m == 1 -%}
          {{ root_sel }} .craft__stats .stat { border-left: 0; }
          {{ root_sel }} .craft__stats .stat + .stat { border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
        {%- endif -%}
      }
    {%- endif -%}
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign strand_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'strand' -%}
{%- assign stat_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'stat' -%}
{%- assign mark_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'mark' -%}
{%- assign shot_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'shot' -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign sp_wall = s.art_wall | default: 'sj-studio-wall-red.webp' | asset_url
  assign sp_cloth = s.art_cloth | default: 'sj-studio-cloth-heritage.webp' | asset_url
  assign sp_front = s.art_front | default: 'sj-studio-pots.webp' | asset_url
  assign sp_detail = s.art_detail | default: 'sj-red-hand-ahir-embroidered-kanchli-3.webp' | asset_url
  assign sp_photo = ''
  if s.art_photo_img != blank
    assign sp_photo = s.art_photo_img | image_url: width: 1400
  elsif s.art_photo != blank
    assign sp_photo = s.art_photo | asset_url
  endif
  assign sp_wa = s.whatsapp | default: '919099974319' | remove: '+' | remove: ' ' | remove: '-'
  assign sp_wa_text = s.whatsapp_text | default: 'Hello Shrujan, I would like to know more about the Heritage Collection.'
-%}
{%- comment -%}
  The premium page (the user, 2026-10-29: Heritage and Avinya are premium
  collections; make them look it, in the home page's language). Styles in
  assets/sj-studio.css; the hero's depth and the WhatsApp message in
  assets/sj-studio.js. The words are this section's settings and blocks.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'sj-studio.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<div class="sp sp--heritage" style="--sp-wall:url({{ sp_wall }}); --sp-detail:url({{ sp_detail }})">
  <header class="sp-hero">
    <span class="sp-hero__ghost" aria-hidden="true">{{ s.hero_ghost | default: 'Heritage' | escape }}</span>
    <div class="sp-hero__text" data-reveal>
      <p class="sp-eyebrow">{{ s.hero_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h1 class="sp-hero__title">{{ s.hero_title }}</h1>
      {%- if s.lead != blank %}<p class="sp-hero__lede">{{ s.lead }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="sp-hero__cta">
        {%- if s.show_enquiry %}<a class="sp-btn sp-btn--solid" href="#heritage-enquiry">{{ s.hero_cta | default: 'Enquire' | escape }} <i class="sj-i sj-i--arrow-right ms" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>{% endif %}
        <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--line" href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone={{ sp_wa }}&text={{ sp_wa_text | url_encode }}" data-sp-wa="{{ sp_wa }}" data-sp-wa-text="{{ sp_wa_text | escape }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="sj-i sj-i--whatsapp-logo fab" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ s.whatsapp_label | default: 'Chat on WhatsApp' | escape }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- if sp_photo != blank %}
    <figure class="sp-hero__photo" data-sp-depth="-0.05">
      <img src="{{ sp_photo }}" alt="{{ s.art_photo_alt | escape }}" fetchpriority="high">
      {%- if s.art_photo_caption != blank %}<figcaption>{{ s.art_photo_caption | escape }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
    </figure>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="sp-hero__art" aria-hidden="true">
      <img class="sp-hero__cloth" src="{{ sp_cloth }}" alt="" data-sp-depth="-0.06" fetchpriority="high">
      <img class="sp-hero__front" src="{{ sp_front }}" alt="" data-sp-depth="0.07" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if s.show_stats and stat_blocks.size > 0 %}
    <ul class="sp-hero__stats" style="--n: {{ stat_blocks.size }}">
      {%- for block in stat_blocks %}
      <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><b>{{ block.settings.value }}</b><span>{{ block.settings.label }}</span></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
  </header>
{%- if s.show_strands %}
  <ul class="sp-tabs" aria-label="Studio Collection">
    {%- for block in strand_blocks %}
    <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><a href="{{ block.settings.link | default: '#' }}"{% if block.settings.current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}><span>{{ forloop.index | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 }}</span>{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
{%- endif %}
{%- if s.show_origin %}
  <section class="sp-intro">
    <div data-reveal>
      {%- if s.intro_eyebrow != blank %}<p class="sp-eyebrow">{{ s.intro_eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="sp-intro__story">{{ s.body }}</div>
    </div>
    <figure class="sp-intro__figure" data-reveal>
      <img src="{{ sp_detail }}" alt="{{ s.art_detail_alt | default: 'The red hand-embroidered Ahir kanchli on a dress form, its embroidery close up' | escape }}" loading="lazy">
    </figure>
  </section>
{%- endif %}
{%- render 'sj-studio-products', s: s, kind: 'heritage', wa: sp_wa -%}
{%- if s.show_marks and mark_blocks.size > 0 %}
  <section class="sp-band">
    <div class="sp-band__head" data-reveal>
      <div>
        {%- if s.marks_eyebrow != blank %}<p class="sp-eyebrow">{{ s.marks_eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
        <h2 class="sp-title">{{ s.marks_title }}</h2>
      </div>
      {%- if s.marks_note != blank %}<p class="sp-band__note">{{ s.marks_note }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <ol class="sp-points" style="--n: {{ mark_blocks.size }}" data-reveal-child>
      {%- for block in mark_blocks %}
      <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><span class="sp-points__no">{{ forloop.index | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 }}</span><h3>{{ block.settings.title }}</h3><p>{{ block.settings.copy }}</p></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>
{%- endif %}
{%- if s.show_arch and shot_blocks.size > 0 %}
  <section class="sp-gallery">
    <div class="sp-gallery__head" data-reveal>
      {%- if s.arch_eyebrow != blank %}<p class="sp-eyebrow">{{ s.arch_eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
      <h2 class="sp-title">{{ s.arch_title }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sp-gallery__grid" data-reveal-child>
      {%- for block in shot_blocks %}
      <figure {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        <img src="{% if block.settings.image %}{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1400 }}{% else %}{{ block.settings.asset | asset_url }}{% endif %}" alt="{{ block.settings.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">
        {%- if block.settings.alt != blank %}<figcaption>{{ block.settings.alt | escape }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
      </figure>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- endif %}
{%- if s.show_pull and s.pull != blank %}
  <blockquote class="sp-quote" data-reveal><p>{{ s.pull }}</p><i class="sp-quote__rule" aria-hidden="true"></i></blockquote>
{%- endif %}
{%- if s.show_enquiry %}
  <section class="sp-enquiry" id="heritage-enquiry" data-done-title="{{ s.done_title | escape }}" data-done-body="{{ s.done_body | escape }}" data-done-again="{{ s.done_again | escape }}">
    <div class="sp-enquiry__side" data-reveal>
      <p class="sp-eyebrow">{{ s.enq_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h2 class="sp-title">{{ s.enq_title }}</h2>
      <p class="sp-enquiry__copy">{{ s.enq_copy }}</p>
      <dl class="sp-enquiry__reach">
        <div><dt>{{ s.call_label }}</dt><dd><a href="tel:{{ s.phone | remove: ' ' }}">{{ s.phone }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>{{ s.write_label }}</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ s.email }}">{{ s.email }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>{{ s.hours_label }}</dt><dd>{{ s.hours }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="sp-enquiry__wa">
        <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--line" href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone={{ sp_wa }}&text={{ sp_wa_text | url_encode }}" data-sp-wa="{{ sp_wa }}" data-sp-wa-text="{{ sp_wa_text | escape }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="sj-i sj-i--whatsapp-logo fab" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ s.whatsapp_label | default: 'Chat on WhatsApp' | escape }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sp-enquiry__main">
      <form class="enquiry__form" data-reveal>
        <p class="field">
          <label for="heritage-enquiry-name">Name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <input id="heritage-enquiry-name" name="name" type="text" required autocomplete="name">
        </p>

        <p class="field">
          <label for="heritage-enquiry-phone">Contact number <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <input id="heritage-enquiry-phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel">
        </p>

        <p class="field">
          <label for="heritage-enquiry-city">City</label>
          <input id="heritage-enquiry-city" name="city" type="text" autocomplete="address-level2">
        </p>

        <p class="field">
          <label for="heritage-enquiry-email">Email</label>
          <input id="heritage-enquiry-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email">
        </p>

        <p class="field">
          <label for="heritage-enquiry-extra">Craft or piece of interest</label>
          <input id="heritage-enquiry-extra" name="extra" type="text" placeholder="Suf, Pakko, Mutwa…">
        </p>

        <p class="field field--wide">
          <label for="heritage-enquiry-looking">What are you looking for?</label>
          <textarea id="heritage-enquiry-looking" name="looking" rows="3"></textarea>
        </p>

        <p class="field">
          <label for="heritage-enquiry-slot">Preferred time slot</label>
          <select id="heritage-enquiry-slot" name="slot">
            <option value="" disabled selected>Choose a time</option>
            <option value="9:00 AM">9:00 AM</option>
            <option value="9:30 AM">9:30 AM</option>
            <option value="10:00 AM">10:00 AM</option>
            <option value="10:30 AM">10:30 AM</option>
            <option value="11:00 AM">11:00 AM</option>
            <option value="11:30 AM">11:30 AM</option>
            <option value="12:00 PM">12:00 PM</option>
            <option value="12:30 PM">12:30 PM</option>
            <option value="1:00 PM">1:00 PM</option>
            <option value="1:30 PM">1:30 PM</option>
            <option value="2:00 PM">2:00 PM</option>
            <option value="2:30 PM">2:30 PM</option>
            <option value="3:00 PM">3:00 PM</option>
            <option value="3:30 PM">3:30 PM</option>
            <option value="4:00 PM">4:00 PM</option>
            <option value="4:30 PM">4:30 PM</option>
            <option value="5:00 PM">5:00 PM</option>
            <option value="5:30 PM">5:30 PM</option>
          </select>
        </p>

        <div class="enquiry__submit">
          <button class="btn" type="submit">{{ section.settings.submit_label }} <i class="sj-i sj-i--arrow-right ms" style="font-size:16px" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
          <span class="enquiry__note"><span aria-hidden="true">*</span> {{ section.settings.note }}</span>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
{%- endif %}
</div>
<script src="{{ 'sj-studio.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script>
(function () {
  var root = document.getElementById('heritage-enquiry');
  if (!root || root.__shrujanInit) return;
  root.__shrujanInit = true;

  var form = root.querySelector('.enquiry__form');
  if (!form) return;

  var arrow = '<i class="sj-i sj-i--arrow-right ms" style="font-size:16px" aria-hidden="true"></i>';

  var done = document.createElement('div');
  done.className = 'enquiry__done';
  done.setAttribute('role', 'status');
  done.setAttribute('data-reveal', '');
  done.innerHTML =
    '<p class="enquiry__done-title">' + (root.getAttribute('data-done-title') || 'Thank you, we have your request.') + '</p>' +
    '<p>' + (root.getAttribute('data-done-body') || 'Someone from the Bhuj studio will call you in your chosen slot. If it is urgent, reach us on <a href="tel:+919099974319">+91 9099 974319</a>.') + '</p>' +
    '<button class="arrow-link" type="button">' + (root.getAttribute('data-done-again') || 'Send another enquiry') + ' ' + arrow + '</button>';

  done.querySelector('button').addEventListener('click', function () {
    form.reset();
    done.replaceWith(form);
  });

  // the enquiry goes to Slide (assets/sj-ui.js, Theme settings → Slide);
  // the thank-you shows once Slide has it, a note with the studio's numbers
  // if it could not be sent
  var err = document.createElement('p');
  err.className = 'enquiry__error';
  err.setAttribute('role', 'alert');
  err.hidden = true;
  err.innerHTML = 'It could not be sent just now. Please try again, or write to us on <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=919099974319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or call <a href="tel:+919099974319">+91 90999 74319</a>.';
  form.querySelector('.enquiry__submit').before(err);
  form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    var btn = form.querySelector('[type="submit"]');
    var slide = window.SJSlide;
    if (!slide) { form.replaceWith(done); return; }
    btn.disabled = true;
    err.hidden = true;
    slide.sendForm(form, { form: 'Heritage enquiry', type: 'Heritage', tags: ['enquiry', 'studio'] }).then(function (ok) {
      btn.disabled = false;
      if (ok) form.replaceWith(done);
      else err.hidden = false;
    });
  });
})();
</script>
{%- endif -%}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Studio · Heritage",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Page"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "only_handle",
      "label": "Only on the page with this handle",
      "info": "The last part of the page address, e.g. lldc for /pages/lldc. Empty draws the section wherever it is placed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hero_eyebrow",
      "label": "Hero eyebrow",
      "default": "Studio Collection · Heritage"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "hero_title",
      "label": "Hero title",
      "default": "Heirlooms, made to be <em>handed on</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "hero_img",
      "label": "Hero background image"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "lead",
      "label": "Intro lead",
      "default": "Heirloom textiles that carry the depth and detail of Kutch’s craft traditions. Each piece is made with exceptional skill and intended to be collected, preserved and passed on."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Intro body",
      "default": "<p>A heritage piece is not a season’s product. It is the fullest expression of a craft a community has kept for generations, made at the pace that craft asks for.</p><p>The embroideries of Kutch are not one tradition but a dozen (Ahir, Mutwa, Jat, Rabari, Suf, Pakko, Kharek), each with its own grammar of stitch, motif and colour, passed from mother to daughter rather than written down. A heritage commission asks an artisan to work at the top of that vocabulary, without abridging it for time.</p><p>That is why these pieces take months rather than weeks. Suf is counted from the reverse of the cloth with no pattern ever drawn. Pakko is worked so tightly the ground disappears. Mirror-work is cut, set and secured one disc at a time. None of it can be hurried without becoming something else.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "arch_eyebrow",
      "label": "Archive eyebrow",
